        -: 4536:** <li> Reset the prepared statement using [sqlite3_reset()] then go back
        -: 4537:**      to step 2.  Do this zero or more times.
        -: 4538:** <li> Destroy the object using [sqlite3_finalize()].
        -: 4539:** </ol>
        -: 4540:*/
