        -:23329:
        -:23330:/* EVIDENCE-OF: R-38720-18127 The default setting is determined by the
        -:23331:** SQLITE_ALLOW_COVERING_INDEX_SCAN compile-time option, or is "on" if
        -:23332:** that compile-time option is omitted.
        -:23333:*/
