        -:38199:**      beginning of the buffer are encoded as a little-endian
        -:38200:**      base-26 number using a..z.  "a" means 0.  "b" means 1,
        -:38201:**      "z" means 25.  "ab" means 26.  "ac" means 52.  And so forth.
        -:38202:**
