        -:38217:      ** base-26 number using a..z as the digits. So one zero is "b".
        -:38218:      ** Two zeros is "c". 25 zeros is "z", 26 zeros is "ab", 27 is "bb",
        -:38219:      ** and so forth.
        -:38220:      */
