        -:38891:
        -:38892:/*
        -:38893:** There are various methods for file locking used for concurrency
        -:38894:** control:
        -:38895:**
        -:38896:**   1. POSIX locking (the default),
        -:38897:**   2. No locking,
        -:38898:**   3. Dot-file locking,
        -:38899:**   4. flock() locking,
        -:38900:**   5. AFP locking (OSX only),
        -:38901:**   6. Named POSIX semaphores (VXWorks only),
        -:38902:**   7. proxy locking. (OSX only)
        -:38903:**
        -:38904:** Styles 4, 5, and 7 are only available of SQLITE_ENABLE_LOCKING_STYLE
        -:38905:** is defined to 1.  The SQLITE_ENABLE_LOCKING_STYLE also enables automatic
