        -:44347:/*
        -:44348:** This division contains definitions of sqlite3_io_methods objects that
        -:44349:** implement various file locking strategies.  It also contains definitions
        -:44350:** of "finder" functions.  A finder-function is used to locate the appropriate
        -:44351:** sqlite3_io_methods object for a particular database file.  The pAppData
        -:44352:** field of the sqlite3_vfs VFS objects are initialized to be pointers to
        -:44353:** the correct finder-function for that VFS.
        -:44354:**
