        -:44357:** looks at the filesystem type and tries to guess the best locking
        -:44358:** strategy from that.
        -:44359:**
        -:44360:** For finder-function F, two objects are created:
        -:44361:**
        -:44362:**    (1) The real finder-function named "FImpt()".
