        -:54778:**
        -:54779:** All bits are clear when the bitmap is created.  Individual bits
        -:54780:** may be set or cleared one at a time.
        -:54781:**
        -:54782:** Test operations are about 100 times more common that set operations.
        -:54783:** Clear operations are exceedingly rare.  There are usually between
        -:54784:** 5 and 500 set operations per Bitvec object, though the number of sets can
        -:54785:** sometimes grow into tens of thousands or larger.  The size of the
        -:54786:** Bitvec object is the number of pages in the database file at the
