        -:57904:**
        -:57905:*************************************************************************
        -:57906:** This is the implementation of the page cache subsystem or "pager".
        -:57907:**
        -:57908:** The pager is used to access a database disk file.  It implements
        -:57909:** atomic commit and rollback through the use of a journal file that
        -:57910:** is separate from the database file.  The pager also implements file
        -:57911:** locking to prevent two processes from writing the same database
        -:57912:** file simultaneously, or one process from reading the database while
        -:57913:** another is writing.
        -:57914:*/
        -:57915:#ifndef SQLITE_OMIT_DISKIO
        -:57916:/* #include "sqliteInt.h" */
        -:57917:/************** Include wal.h in the middle of pager.c ***********************/
        -:57918:/************** Begin file wal.h *********************************************/
