        -:58567:**   super-journal pointer could interfere with hot-journal rollback of any
        -:58568:**   subsequently interrupted transaction that reuses the journal file.
        -:58569:**
        -:58570:**   The flag is cleared as soon as the journal file is finalized (either
        -:58571:**   by PagerCommitPhaseTwo or PagerRollback). If an IO error prevents the
        -:58572:**   journal file from being successfully finalized, the setSuper flag
