        -:66142:/*
        -:66143:** The maximum (and only) versions of the wal and wal-index formats
        -:66144:** that may be interpreted by this version of SQLite.
        -:66145:**
        -:66146:** If a client begins recovering a WAL file and finds that (a) the checksum
        -:66147:** values in the wal-header are correct and (b) the version field is not
        -:66148:** WAL_MAX_VERSION, recovery fails and SQLite returns SQLITE_CANTOPEN.
