        -:66185:
        -:66186:/*
        -:66187:** The following object holds a copy of the wal-index header content.
        -:66188:**
        -:66189:** The actual header in the wal-index consists of two copies of this
        -:66190:** object followed by one instance of the WalCkptInfo object.
        -:66191:** For all versions of SQLite through 3.10.0 and probably beyond,
        -:66192:** the locking bytes (WalCkptInfo.aLock) start at offset 120 and
        -:66193:** the total header size is 136 bytes.
        -:66194:**
        -:66195:** The szPage value can be any power of 2 between 512 and 32768, inclusive.
        -:66196:** Or it can be 1 to represent a 65536-byte page.  The latter case was
        -:66197:** added in 3.7.1 when support for 64K pages was added.
