        -:66289:**      +-----------------------------+  |
        -:66290:**   8: | iChange                     |  |
        -:66291:**      +-------+-------+-------------+  |
        -:66292:**  12: | bInit |  bBig |   szPage    |  |
        -:66293:**      +-------+-------+-------------+  |
        -:66294:**  16: | mxFrame                     |  |  First copy of the
        -:66295:**      +-----------------------------+  |  WalIndexHdr object
        -:66296:**  20: | nPage                       |  |
        -:66297:**      +-----------------------------+  |
        -:66298:**  24: | aFrameCksum                 |  |
        -:66299:**      |                             |  |
        -:66300:**      +-----------------------------+  |
        -:66301:**  32: | aSalt                       |  |
        -:66302:**      |                             |  |
        -:66303:**      +-----------------------------+  |
        -:66304:**  40: | aCksum                      |  |
        -:66305:**      |                             | /
        -:66306:**      +-----------------------------+
        -:66307:**  48: | iVersion                    | \
        -:66308:**      +-----------------------------+  |
        -:66309:**  52: | (unused padding)            |  |
        -:66310:**      +-----------------------------+  |
        -:66311:**  56: | iChange                     |  |
        -:66312:**      +-------+-------+-------------+  |
        -:66313:**  60: | bInit |  bBig |   szPage    |  |
        -:66314:**      +-------+-------+-------------+  |  Second copy of the
        -:66315:**  64: | mxFrame                     |  |  WalIndexHdr
        -:66316:**      +-----------------------------+  |
        -:66317:**  68: | nPage                       |  |
        -:66318:**      +-----------------------------+  |
        -:66319:**  72: | aFrameCksum                 |  |
        -:66320:**      |                             |  |
        -:66321:**      +-----------------------------+  |
        -:66322:**  80: | aSalt                       |  |
        -:66323:**      |                             |  |
        -:66324:**      +-----------------------------+  |
        -:66325:**  88: | aCksum                      |  |
        -:66326:**      |                             | /
        -:66327:**      +-----------------------------+
        -:66328:**  96: | nBackfill                   |
        -:66329:**      +-----------------------------+
        -:66330:** 100: | 5 read marks                |
        -:66331:**      |                             |
        -:66332:**      |                             |
        -:66333:**      |                             |
        -:66334:**      |                             |
        -:66335:**      +-------+-------+------+------+
        -:66336:** 120: | Write | Ckpt  | Rcvr | Rd0  | \
