        -:66339:**      +-------+-------+------+------+
        -:66340:** 128: | nBackfillAttempted          |
        -:66341:**      +-----------------------------+
        -:66342:** 132: | (unused padding)            |
        -:66343:**      +-----------------------------+
        -:66344:*/
