        -:70822:/*
        -:70823:** A linked list of the following structures is stored at BtShared.pLock.
        -:70824:** Locks are added (or upgraded from READ_LOCK to WRITE_LOCK) when a cursor
        -:70825:** is opened on the table with root page BtShared.iTable. Locks are removed
