        -:70881:/*
        -:70882:** Btree.inTrans may take one of the following values.
        -:70883:**
        -:70884:** If the shared-data extension is enabled, there may be multiple users
        -:70885:** of the Btree structure. At most one of these may open a write transaction,
        -:70886:** but any number may have active read transactions.
