        -:71033:** found at self->pBt->mutex.
        -:71034:**
        -:71035:** skipNext meaning:
        -:71036:** The meaning of skipNext depends on the value of eState:
        -:71037:**
        -:71038:**   eState            Meaning of skipNext
        -:71039:**   VALID             skipNext is meaningless and is ignored
        -:71040:**   INVALID           skipNext is meaningless and is ignored
