        -:71042:**                     sqlite3BtreePrevious() is no-op if skipNext<0.
        -:71043:**   REQUIRESEEK       restoreCursorPosition() restores the cursor to
        -:71044:**                     eState=SKIPNEXT if skipNext!=0
        -:71045:**   FAULT             skipNext holds the cursor fault error code.
