        -:71085:
        -:71086:/*
        -:71087:** Potential values for BtCursor.eState.
        -:71088:**
        -:71089:** CURSOR_INVALID:
        -:71090:**   Cursor does not point to a valid entry. This can happen (for example)
        -:71091:**   because the table is empty or because BtreeCursorFirst() has not been
        -:71092:**   called.
        -:71093:**
        -:71094:** CURSOR_VALID:
