        -:71096:**
        -:71097:** CURSOR_SKIPNEXT:
        -:71098:**   Cursor is valid except that the Cursor.skipNext field is non-zero
        -:71099:**   indicating that the next sqlite3BtreeNext() or sqlite3BtreePrevious()
        -:71100:**   operation should be a no-op.
        -:71101:**
        -:71102:** CURSOR_REQUIRESEEK:
