        -:71104:**   modified since the cursor was last used. The cursor position is saved
        -:71105:**   in variables BtCursor.pKey and BtCursor.nKey. When a cursor is in
        -:71106:**   this state, restoreCursorPosition() can be called to attempt to
        -:71107:**   seek the cursor to the saved position.
        -:71108:**
        -:71109:** CURSOR_FAULT:
