        -:72198:** moved to become a free-list leaf page, the corresponding bit is
        -:72199:** set in the bitvec. Whenever a leaf page is extracted from the free-list,
        -:72200:** optimization 2 above is omitted if the corresponding bit is already
        -:72201:** set in BtShared.pHasContent. The contents of the bitvec are cleared
        -:72202:** at the end of every transaction.
