        -:99335:** might be the target row, or it might be near and slightly before the
        -:99336:** target row, or it might be after the target row.  If the cursor is
        -:99337:** currently before the target row, then this opcode attempts to position
        -:99338:** the cursor on or after the target row by invoking sqlite3BtreeStep()
        -:99339:** on the cursor between 1 and This.P1 times.
