        -:104297:** The aReadr[] array contains a PmaReader object for each of the PMAs being
        -:104298:** merged.  An aReadr[] object either points to a valid key or else is at EOF.
        -:104299:** ("EOF" means "End Of File".  When aReadr[] is at EOF there is no more data.)
        -:104300:** For the purposes of the paragraphs below, we assume that the array is
        -:104301:** actually N elements in size, where N is the smallest power of 2 greater
        -:104302:** to or equal to the number of PMAs being merged. The extra aReadr[] elements
        -:104303:** are treated as if they are empty (always at EOF).
