        -:104314:** other key value. If the keys are equal (only possible with two EOF
        -:104315:** values), it doesn't matter which index is stored.
        -:104316:**
        -:104317:** The (N/4) elements of aTree[] that precede the final (N/2) described
        -:104318:** above contains the index of the smallest of each block of 4 PmaReaders
