        -:104327:**     aReadr[3] -> Currant
        -:104328:**     aReadr[4] -> Grapefruit
        -:104329:**     aReadr[5] -> Apple
        -:104330:**     aReadr[6] -> Durian
        -:104331:**     aReadr[7] -> EOF
