        -:107821:** constants to specify how to proceed with the walk.
        -:107822:**
        -:107823:**    WRC_Continue      Continue descending down the tree.
        -:107824:**
        -:107825:**    WRC_Prune         Do not descend into child nodes, but allow
        -:107826:**                      the walk to continue with sibling nodes.
        -:107827:**
        -:107828:**    WRC_Abort         Do no more callbacks.  Unwind the stack and
        -:107829:**                      return from the top-level walk call.
        -:107830:**
        -:107831:** The return value from this routine is WRC_Abort to abandon the tree walk
        -:107832:** and WRC_Continue to continue.
        -:107833:*/
