        -:122764:
        -:122765:/*
        -:122766:** Set or clear the access authorization function.
        -:122767:**
        -:122768:** The access authorization function is be called during the compilation
        -:122769:** phase to verify that the user has read and/or write access permission on
        -:122770:** various fields of the database.  The first argument to the auth function
        -:122771:** is a copy of the 3rd argument to this routine.  The second argument
        -:122772:** to the auth function is one of these constants:
        -:122773:**
        -:122774:**       SQLITE_CREATE_INDEX
        -:122775:**       SQLITE_CREATE_TABLE
        -:122776:**       SQLITE_CREATE_TEMP_INDEX
