        -:145070:**     NATURAL  LEFT     OUTER               JT_NATURAL|JT_LEFT|JT_OUTER
        -:145071:**     NATURAL  RIGHT      -                 JT_NATURAL|JT_RIGHT|JT_OUTER
        -:145072:**     NATURAL  RIGHT    OUTER               JT_NATURAL|JT_RIGHT|JT_OUTER
        -:145073:**     NATURAL  FULL       -                 JT_NATURAL|JT_LEFT|JT_RIGHT
