        -:159138:
        -:159139:/* The WhereOrSet object holds a set of possible WhereOrCosts that
        -:159140:** correspond to the subquery(s) of OR-clause processing.  Only the
        -:159141:** best N_OR_COST elements are retained.
        -:159142:*/
