        -:159336:
        -:159337:/*
        -:159338:** An instance of the following structure keeps track of a mapping
        -:159339:** between VDBE cursor numbers and bits of the bitmasks in WhereTerm.
        -:159340:**
        -:159341:** The VDBE cursor numbers are small integers contained in
        -:159342:** SrcItem.iCursor and Expr.iTable fields.  For any given WHERE
        -:159343:** clause, the cursor numbers might not begin with 0 and they might
