        -:159392:
        -:159393:/* The WhereLoopBuilder.iPlanLimit is used to limit the number of
        -:159394:** index+constraint combinations the query planner will consider for a
        -:159395:** particular query.  If this parameter is unlimited, then certain
        -:159396:** pathological queries can spend excess time in the sqlite3WhereBegin()
        -:159397:** routine.  The limit is high enough that is should not impact real-world
        -:159398:** queries.
        -:159399:**
        -:159400:** SQLITE_QUERY_PLANNER_LIMIT is the baseline limit.  The limit is
        -:159401:** increased by SQLITE_QUERY_PLANNER_LIMIT_INCR before each term of the FROM
        -:159402:** clause is processed, so that every table in a join is guaranteed to be
