        -:159412:
        -:159413:/*
        -:159414:** The WHERE clause processing routine has two halves.  The
        -:159415:** first part does the start of the WHERE loop and the second
        -:159416:** half does the tail of the WHERE loop.  An instance of
        -:159417:** this structure is returned by the first half and passed
