        -:169936:**
        -:169937:** For the purposes of this heuristic, a star-query is defined as a query
        -:169938:** with a large central table that is joined using an INNER JOIN,
        -:169939:** not CROSS or OUTER JOINs, against four or more smaller tables.
        -:169940:** The central table is called the "fact" table.  The smaller tables
        -:169941:** that get joined are "dimension tables".  Also, any table that is
