        -:175830:/* Define the yytestcase() macro to be a no-op if is not already defined
        -:175831:** otherwise.
        -:175832:**
        -:175833:** Applications can choose to define yytestcase() in the %include section
        -:175834:** to a macro that can assist in verifying code coverage.  For production
        -:175835:** code the yytestcase() macro should be turned off.  But it is useful
        -:175836:** for testing.
        -:175837:*/
        -:175838:#ifndef yytestcase
