        -:182312:**
        -:182313:**   (1) START     At the beginning or end of an SQL statement.  This routine
        -:182314:**                 returns 1 if it ends in the START state and 0 if it ends
        -:182315:**                 in any other state.
        -:182316:**
        -:182317:**   (2) NORMAL    We are in the middle of statement which ends with a single
        -:182318:**                 semicolon.
