        -:188647:/* A complete hash table is an instance of the following structure.
        -:188648:** The internals of this structure are intended to be opaque -- client
        -:188649:** code should not attempt to access or modify the fields of this structure
        -:188650:** directly.  Change this structure only by using the routines below.
        -:188651:** However, many of the "procedures" and "functions" for modifying and
