        -:188981:  ** A single FTS4 table may have multiple full-text indexes. For each index
        -:188982:  ** there is an entry in the aIndex[] array. Index 0 is an index of all the
        -:188983:  ** terms that appear in the document set. Each subsequent index in aIndex[]
        -:188984:  ** is an index of prefixes of a specific length.
        -:188985:  **
        -:188986:  ** Variable nPendingData contains an estimate the memory consumed by the
