        -:195861:******************************************************************************
        -:195862:**
        -:195863:** This module contains code that implements a parser for fts3 query strings
        -:195864:** (the right-hand argument to the MATCH operator). Because the supported
        -:195865:** syntax is relatively simple, the whole tokenizer/parser system is
        -:195866:** hand-coded.
