        -:195870:
        -:195871:/*
        -:195872:** By default, this module parses the legacy syntax that has been
        -:195873:** traditionally used by fts3. Or, if SQLITE_ENABLE_FTS3_PARENTHESIS
        -:195874:** is defined, then it uses the new syntax. The differences between
        -:195875:** the new and the old syntaxes are:
        -:195876:**
        -:195877:**  a) The new syntax supports parenthesis. The old does not.
        -:195878:**
        -:195879:**  b) The new syntax supports the AND and NOT operators. The old does not.
        -:195880:**
        -:195881:**  c) The old syntax supports the "-" token qualifier. This is not
        -:195882:**     supported by the new syntax (it is replaced by the NOT operator).
        -:195883:**
