        -:196986:/*
        -:196987:** Return a pointer to a buffer containing a text representation of the
        -:196988:** expression passed as the first argument. The buffer is obtained from
        -:196989:** sqlite3_malloc(). It is the responsibility of the caller to use
        -:196990:** sqlite3_free() to release the memory. If an OOM condition is encountered,
