        -:197039:/*
        -:197040:** This is the implementation of a scalar SQL function used to test the
        -:197041:** expression parser. It should be called as follows:
        -:197042:**
        -:197043:**   fts3_exprtest(<tokenizer>, <expr>, <column 1>, ...);
        -:197044:**
        -:197045:** The first argument, <tokenizer>, is the name of the fts3 tokenizer used
        -:197046:** to parse the query expression (see README.tokenizers). The second argument
        -:197047:** is the query expression to parse. Each subsequent argument is the name
        -:197048:** of a column of the fts3 table that the query expression may refer to.
