        -:198674:#endif
        -:198675:
        -:198676:/*
        -:198677:** Set up SQL objects in database db used to access the contents of
        -:198678:** the hash table pointed to by argument pHash. The hash table must
        -:198679:** been initialized to use string keys, and to take a private copy
        -:198680:** of the key when a value is inserted. i.e. by a call similar to:
