        -:217708:**          table corresponding to the cell's rowid value that
        -:217709:**          points to the correct node.
        -:217710:**
        -:217711:**       d) for cells on non-leaf nodes, that there is an entry in the
        -:217712:**          %_parent table mapping from the cell's child node to the
        -:217713:**          node that it resides on.
        -:217714:**
        -:217715:**   2. That there are the same number of entries in the %_rowid table
        -:217716:**      as there are leaf cells in the r-tree structure, and that there
        -:217717:**      is a leaf cell that corresponds to each entry in the %_rowid table.
