        -:221631:#endif
        -:221632:
        -:221633:/*
        -:221634:** RBU handle.
        -:221635:**
        -:221636:** nPhaseOneStep:
        -:221637:**   If the RBU database contains an rbu_count table, this value is set to
        -:221638:**   a running estimate of the number of b-tree operations required to
        -:221639:**   finish populating the *-oal file. This allows the sqlite3_bp_progress()
        -:221640:**   API to calculate the permyriadage progress of populating the *-oal file
        -:221641:**   using the formula:
        -:221642:**
        -:221643:**     permyriadage = (10000 * nProgress) / nPhaseOneStep
        -:221644:**
        -:221645:**   nPhaseOneStep is initialized to the sum of:
        -:221646:**
        -:221647:**     nRow * (nIndex + 1)
