        -:234799:******************************************************************************
        -:234800:**
        -:234801:** Interfaces to extend FTS5. Using the interfaces defined in this file,
        -:234802:** FTS5 may be extended with:
        -:234803:**
        -:234804:**     * custom tokenizers, and
        -:234805:**     * custom auxiliary functions.
