        -:261742:******************************************************************************
        -:261743:**
        -:261744:** This is an SQLite virtual table module implementing direct access to an
        -:261745:** existing FTS5 index. The module may create several different types of
        -:261746:** tables:
        -:261747:**
        -:261748:** col:
        -:261749:**     CREATE TABLE vocab(term, col, doc, cnt, PRIMARY KEY(term, col));
        -:261750:**
        -:261751:**   One row for each term/column combination. The value of $doc is set to
        -:261752:**   the number of fts5 rows that contain at least one instance of term
        -:261753:**   $term within column $col. Field $cnt is set to the total number of
        -:261754:**   instances of term $term in column $col (in any row of the fts5 table).
        -:261755:**
        -:261756:** row:
        -:261757:**     CREATE TABLE vocab(term, doc, cnt, PRIMARY KEY(term));
        -:261758:**
        -:261759:**   One row for each term in the database. The value of $doc is set to
        -:261760:**   the number of fts5 rows that contain at least one instance of term
        -:261761:**   $term. Field $cnt is set to the total number of instances of term
        -:261762:**   $term in the database.
        -:261763:**
        -:261764:** instance:
        -:261765:**     CREATE TABLE vocab(term, doc, col, offset, PRIMARY KEY(<all-fields>));
        -:261766:**
        -:261767:**   One row for each term instance in the database.
        -:261768:*/
